              <h2>Movie Reviews — Legacy ASP.NET Core Coursework Project</h2>
              <p>This was a course project focused on building a secure, role-based admin experience for a movie catalog and user reviews. It was part of my earlier ASP.NET Core work and is kept here as an additional sample rather than one of the current featured projects.</p>
              <p>As the sole developer I designed and implemented the data models, EF Core migrations, role seeding, admin dashboard, Azure Blob Storage integration, and cookie-based authentication with custom routes.</p>

